&lt;p style="margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left; line-height: 1"&gt;
&lt;img alt="0102010_036.png" src="images/0102010_036.png" style="height: 32.59px; width: 34.67px"/&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
